From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:07:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] CPU features in SYSINFO; os0test SIMD state checks

mos_sysinfo_cpu_features(), mos_sysinfo_xcr0() and mos_cpu_has() report
what the CPU has and the OS has enabled. os0test loads patterns into the
vector, x87 and control registers and checks they survive sleeps, page
faults and system calls, on several threads and a child process.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0112xJofPtaNLntSK14Rcenm
