thread.h: mos_cpu_count, mos_cpu_current, mos_threads_multicore,
mos_thread_set/get_affinity and mos_thread_set/get_priority. os0test checks
that threads run in parallel, stresses shared memory operations across
CPUs, stale TLB entries after unmap/protect, and group exit and crash
while siblings run on other CPUs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
